MODULE 2: STRUCTURED, SEMI-STRUCTURED, AND UNSTRUCTURED DATA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

INTRODUCTION: 

- In this module, you will learn how data can be classified as structured, semi-structured, or
    unstructured data and the challenges that arise when working with unstructured data.


LEARNING OBJECTIVES:

- After completing this module, you should be able to:
    -> Differentiate between structured, semi-structured, and unstructured data
    -> Identify challenges that come with working with unstructured data